{"4881430":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"HueTrix","steam_appid":4881430,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4881470],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HueTrix — Stack the Colors. Break the Board. Get Stronger.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HueTrix is a colorful block-stacking puzzle with a roguelike economy. Clear lines to earn cash, spend it in the shop on powerful mythic relics, and build a game-breaking run that grows stronger every round.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Seven Colors, Seven Effects<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every color carries its own effect. Group matching colors and clear them in chains to send your earnings soaring — the longer the combo, the bigger the payout.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💰 Earn, Shop, Strategize<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, clearing lines fills your wallet. Spend it in the shop to shape your strategy with mythic relics like Hephaestus's Hammer, the Rainbow Crown, and the Rainbow Covenant — game-changing artifacts that turn the board in your favor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔁 Endless Build Variety<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which colors do you invest in? Which relics do you combine? Every run plays out differently. Easy to pick up, deep to master.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 Comfortable to Play<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for keyboard and Xbox \/ PlayStation controllers. Your progress syncs automatically through Steam Cloud, and Steam Achievements keep you chasing that next milestone.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HueTrix — Stack the Colors. Break the Board. Get Stronger.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HueTrix is a colorful block-stacking puzzle with a roguelike economy. Clear lines to earn cash, spend it in the shop on powerful mythic relics, and build a game-breaking run that grows stronger every round.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Seven Colors, Seven Effects<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every color carries its own effect. Group matching colors and clear them in chains to send your earnings soaring — the longer the combo, the bigger the payout.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💰 Earn, Shop, Strategize<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, clearing lines fills your wallet. Spend it in the shop to shape your strategy with mythic relics like Hephaestus's Hammer, the Rainbow Crown, and the Rainbow Covenant — game-changing artifacts that turn the board in your favor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔁 Endless Build Variety<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which colors do you invest in? Which relics do you combine? Every run plays out differently. Easy to pick up, deep to master.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 Comfortable to Play<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for keyboard and Xbox \/ PlayStation controllers. Your progress syncs automatically through Steam Cloud, and Steam Achievements keep you chasing that next milestone.<\/p>","short_description":"HueTrix is a colorful block-stacking puzzle with a roguelike twist: clear lines to earn cash, then spend it in the shop on powerful mythic relics. Chain combos across seven colors, stack permanent upgrades, and build a game-breaking run. Easy to learn, endlessly deep, full controller support.ㄴ","supported_languages":"English, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4881430\/3b9752a1a335e876400e6102b43ee95c69322dc0\/header.jpg?t=1793745839","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4881430\/c0ef20e592546c53d9b4c637c1cb9d685e0ef9d3\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793745839","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akama